ggling over the barbed wire fences along the Thames, their faces obscured by the thick fog.\n\n## blog_1375\nMAGE-detector Δ=-0.089; public-RoBERTa Δ=-0.000\n- α=-2: rest of the group went on the roller coaster. He then joined us and we all went on the roller coaster together. The ride was fun and fast and I remember feeling like I was going to throw up. We got off and went to get ice cream. I remember getting a chocolate one and Adrian got a vanilla one. We all sat down and started eating our ice creams. Then we all went\n- α=+2: rest of the group went on the roller coaster. He then got on with us and we all rode it together. The ride was fun and fast, and I felt like I was flying. When we got off, Diana was smiling again. We all went back to the main area and got some food. After eating, we went to see a show. The show was about superheroes and it was really\n{\n  \"seconds\": 376.9040517807007,\n  \"model\": \"artifacts/models/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n  \"dtype\": \"bfloat16\",\n  \"batch_size\": 4,\n  \"max_new_tokens\": 80,\n  \"seed\": 42,\n  \"instruct\": true\n}{\n  \"seconds\": 74.98086023330688,\n  \"model\": \"artifacts/models/Qwen2.5-7B\",\n  \"dtype\": \"bfloat16\",\n  \"batch_size\": 4,\n  \"max_new_tokens\": 80,\n  \"seed\": 42,\n  \"instruct\": false\n}results/condition_summary.csv\ncheckpoint,condition,strength,n,detector_ai_mean,detector_ai_sd,public_ai_mean,public_ai_sd,perplexity_mean,words_mean,repetition_mean,semantic_mean\nqwen25_7b_base,ai,-2.0,12,0.6672498018787266,0.24991778750870164,0.8705647786458334,0.27562614190090445,5.925038784742355,57.75,0.2338492303281791,0.8344815845290819\nqwen25_7b_base,ai,0.0,12,0.6606579919952464,0.2664434934019111,0.9261372884114584,0.2346224862950168,7.444303880135219,58.0,0.18604111964022976,1.000000074505806\nqwen25_7b_base,ai,2.0,12,0.6989569282626914,0.2371216899795002,0.9036305745442709,0.2635822714920171,5.882977257172267,57.916666666666664,0.21794478080742655,0.8194586535294851\nqwen25_7b_instruct,ai,-